      "english": "In Jungian psychology, a suddenly aging dream is linked to the emergence of the 'Wise Old Man or Woman' archetype from the collective unconscious. It reflects the ego's process of connecting with deeper wisdom within the psyche. The aging imagery can symbolize a stage in individuation — the integration of the Shadow and Persona toward a more complete self. This is generally a positive sign that the conscious ego is transitioning toward a more psychologically mature state."
